\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Russia-Ukraine war live: Ukrainian forces destroyed Russian military transport ship near Mariupol\b0\par\par\uc2 7,888 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 EN VIVONews in DevelopmentTheUkrainian navy claimed Thursday that it destroyed a Russian military transport ship\par \par \uc2 anchored in the port of Berdiansk, a city near the besieged Mariupol on the Sea of Azov....24.03.2022\par \par \uc2 08:09\par \par \uc2 Kharkov attacked with missiles from the Black Sea The center of Kharkov, Ukraine's second largest city in the northeast of the country, was attacked by Russian forces with Kalibr cruise missiles launched from the Black Sea.This was reported by Ukrainian media, citing the governor of the Kharkov Oblast, Ole Synyehubov.According to the official, the region was hit Thursday by\par \par \uc2 atotal of 44 attacks\par \par \uc2 , shelled with multiple shots from Hail and Hurricane rocket launchers and Kalibr cruise missiles24.03.2022\par \par \uc2 07:50\par \par \uc2 Ukraine says it has destroyed a Russian military transport ship in the Sea of AzovTheUkrainian Navy reported Thursday that it had sunk the Russian ship Orsk in the Sea of Asov. AP Photo.\par \par \uc2 The Ukrainian navy claimed Thursday to have destroyed a Russian military transport ship\par \par \uc2 anchored in the port of Berdiansk, a city near besieged Mariupol in the southeastern Sea of Azov."The troop transport ship Orsk has been destroyed in the occupied port of Berdiansk. Glory to Ukraine!" the navy wrote on its \uc2 Facebook\uc2  account.\par \par \uc2 24.03.2022\par \par \uc2 07:30\par \par \uc2 One month of invasion: more than 3.6 million refugees spread across EuropeTheRussian invasion of Ukraine, which began a month ago, triggered a movement of refugees in Europe not seen since