2\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  deployed in that country.\par \par \uc2 "We strongly condemn Russia's unjustified attack on Ukraine," the presidents of the European Commission, Ursula von der Leyen, and the European Council, Charles Michel, said in separate messages on their official Twitter accounts.\par \par \uc2 In the message, also posted on his profile by the EU High Representative for Foreign Policy, Josep Borrell, on the same social network, they said that "in these dark hours, our thoughts are with Ukraine and the innocent women, men and children facing this unprovoked attack and fearing for their lives." {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.clarin.com/mundo/ue-condeno-injustificado-ataque-ucrania-advirtio-rusia-rendira-cuentas-_0_5EiCSE9QM6.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.clarin.com/mundo/ue-condeno-injustificado-ataque-ucrania-advirtio-rusia-rendira-cuentas-_0_5EiCSE9QM6.html }}}\par \par \uc2 24.02.2022\par \par \uc2 03:14\par \par \uc2 Russia starts attacking Ukraine: its troops are already trying to take control of Kiev airport and advancing on other strategic citiesMinutes after Vladimir Putin announced the start of a "special military \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 " in Ukraine, explosions and power outages began to be recorded in Kiev and other Ukrainian cities.\par \par \uc2 The Ukrainian capital was the target of the first bombings launched by Russia.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the Kremlin's airborne forces are trying to take control of the Kiev airport, U.S. Senator Marco Rubio, one of the members of the U.S. Senate Intelligence Committee, confirmed on Twitter. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.clarin.com/mundo/rusia-empieza-atacar-ucrania-explosiones-cortes-energia-kiev-ciudades-clave_0_tyvVsiGYFY.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.clarin.com/mundo/rusia-empieza-atacar-ucrania-explosiones-cortes-energia-kiev-ciudades-clave_0_tyvVsiGYFY.html }}}\par \par \uc2 24.02.2022\par \par \uc2 03:12\par \par \uc2 