o include NATO's spearhead unit. The very high readiness joint task force (VJTF)."\par \par \uc2 "...The NRF can be deployed in disaster relief missions as well as in crisis response."\par \par \uc2 25.02.2022\par \par \uc2 16:13\par \par \uc2 Paula Lugones\par \par \uc2 U.S. gears up for cyber warfareThe invasion of Russian troops in Ukraine shocks the world and the alarm goes beyond the battlefield. Is there a danger of cyberwar? Yes, and fears are growing in the United States of a cyberattack by the Kremlin or Russian hackers on critical infrastructure, with serious consequences for millions of Americans.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2  monitors the situation with its specialized agency, the \uc2 Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency\uc2  (CISA) and so far no major intrusions have taken place. But experts consulted by Clar\u237\'00\'EDn affirm that they are preparing for an attack. Read more here\par \par \uc2 25.02.2022\par \par \uc2 16:03\par \par \uc2 Pope Francis: "War is a failure of politics".Pope Francis made a publication in several languages, including Russian, in which he affirms that "every war is a shameful claudication", following the invasion of Ukraine by Russia.\par \par \uc2 "Every war leaves the world worse off than it found it. War is a failure of politics and of humanity, a shameful surrender, a defeat in the face of the force of evil," Francis said, quoting a phrase from his latest encyclical "Fratelli tutti" dedicated to fraternity.\par \par \uc2 25.02.2022\par \par \uc2 16:00\par \par \uc2 Poland confirmed the delivery of ammunition to UkrainePolish Defense Minister Mariusz B?aszczak confirmed on social networks that they sent ammunition to Ukraine to fight against Russia's invasion.\par \par \uc2 "The convoy with the ammunition we delivered to Ukraine has already reached our neighbors. We support Ukrainians, stand in solidarity and strongly oppose Russian aggression," he posted on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  .\