 by the service company. The coiled tubing equipment has now been demobilised from the production site.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Outlook\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 There is no update on the timing of the workover on Well 20.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Financial review \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                                                                 Second \par                                                              First half           half     First half \par                                                                    2021           2020           2020 \par                                                             (unaudited)    (unaudited)    (unaudited) \par Operating results                                                    $m             $m             $m \par  \par Revenue \par Oil                                                                 8.8            8.5            8.1 \par Gas                                                                26.4           22.3           24.4 \par Liquefied petroleum gas                                             4.0            3.4            2.2 \par Other                                                               0.3            0.3            0.4 \par                                                                    39.5           34.5           35.1 \par --------------------------------------------------------  -------------  -------------  ------------- \par  \par Cost of sales \par Exceptional item - net reversal of provision/(provision \par  for disputed production based taxes)                               1.8           14.6          (1.1) \par Other production based taxes                                      (9.9)          (6.8)          (7.0) \par Depreciation, depletion and amortisation \par  - oil and gas assets                                             (5.6)          (6.1)         (11.0) \par Other cost of sales                                               (7.2) 