d production based taxes in respect of 2010 and 2015, also referred to interchangeably as rental fee claims through this report. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                                        Disputed \par                                                      production \par                                                  based taxes(1) \par Current provisions                                         $000 \par ---------------------------------------------  ---------------- \par At 1 January 2020                                        15,861 \par Foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  translation                            (1,788) \par Amount provided in the period                               341 \par Reclassification from non-current provisions             12,793 \par At 30 June 2020                                          27,207 \par ---------------------------------------------  ---------------- \par  \par  \par                                               Production \par                                           based taxes(1) \par Non-current provisions                              $000 \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par JKX Oil & Gas PLC Half-year Report -13-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------  --------------- \par At 1 January 2020                                 25,405 \par Foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  translation                     (2,865) \par Amount provided in the period                        758 \par Reclassification to current provisions          (12,793) \par ---------------------------------------  --------------- \par At 30 June 2020                                   10,505 \par ---------------------------------------  --------------- \par  \par  \par  \par                                                Production        Onerous \par                                                     based          lease \par    